<star-bg ring="{{false}}" />

<view class="page-body">
  <!-- 收集进度 -->
  <view class="cx-head fade-up">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view>
        <view class="title-lg">命途图鉴</view>
        <text class="small muted" style="display:block;margin-top:8rpx">
          每一个角色都是一条你没走过的路
        </text>
      </view>
      <view class="cx-count">
        <text class="cx-count-num">{{unlockedCount}}</text>
        <text class="cx-count-total">/ {{total}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="cx-bar">
      <view class="cx-bar-fill" style="width:{{percent}}%"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 筛选 -->
  <view class="cx-filters fade-up delay-1">
    <view class="cx-chip-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{rarityFilters}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="cx-chip {{rarityKey === item.key ? 'cx-chip-on' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="onRarityTap"
      >{{item.name}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="cx-chip-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{statusFilters}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="cx-chip {{statusKey === item.key ? 'cx-chip-on' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="onStatusTap"
      >{{item.name}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 列表 -->
  <view class="cx-grid">
    <view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id" class="cx-cell">
      <char-card
        char="{{item.char}}"
        rarity="{{item.rarity}}"
        resonance="{{item.score}}"
        size="md"
        locked="{{!item.unlocked}}"
        show-fates="{{false}}"
        bindtapcard="onCardTap"
      />
      <text wx:if="{{item.countText}}" class="cx-count-text">{{item.countText}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{list.length === 0}}" class="cx-empty">
    <text class="muted">这个筛选下还没有角色</text>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onDraw">去匹配，遇见新的命途</view>
  </view>

  <view class="disclaimer">
    角色名与作品名仅用于指代与娱乐性解读，相关权利归各自权利人所有。
    本页所有描述均为原创文字，未使用任何官方素材。
  </view>
</view>
